    {
      "name": "__LL_I2C_RISE_TIME",
      "sig": "#define __LL_I2C_RISE_TIME(__FREQRANGE__, __SPEED__)                    (uint32_t)(((__SPEED__) <= LL_I2C_MAX_SPEED_STANDARD) ? ((__FREQRANGE__) + 1U) : ((((__FREQRANGE__) * 300U) / 1000U) + 1U))",
      "brief": "计算 I2C 时钟上升时间 TRISE 值: 标准模式(速度≤LL_I2C_MAX_SPEED_STANDARD)为 FREQRANGE+1, 快速模式为 FREQRANGE*300/1000+1。",
